# QA Safety

- Fail closed. Prefer BLOCKED over guessed PASS.
- Never call production booking paths without sandbox proof + ALLOW_SANDBOX_WRITES=YES + ACK_TARGET_NUMBER=YES.
- Never modify the production receptionist system prompt without explicit operator approval.
- Never cancel/reschedule/create on calendars that are not the verified sandbox calendar ID.
- Use synthetic owners/pets only. Do not store real customer PII in qa_runs.
- Do not log or commit API keys.
- AUDIO/FAULT/DROP require TEST_ADAPTER_URL; otherwise BLOCKED.
- Spoken confirmation is not booking evidence.
